00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,600
Don't drop it. Don't drop it.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,300
Four minutes.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,600
No sender. Just a tag, folded shut and addressed in a hand I almost recognise.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
It's not for me.
Read the tag.

5
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,900
It's addressed to me.
